@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
hide footbox
title US018 - As a User, I want to add one of my publications to a list of mine.

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

actor User
participant "MiteLovers" as System

User -> System : I want to add one of my publications to one of my lists
activate "System"
System --> User : Select what available books you want to add:
User -> System : Selection
System --> User : Select what list you want to add them to:
User -> System : Selection
System --> User : Done
deactivate "System"

@enduml